Scary fish:"Hey there!"
Scary fish:"Well, you sure are lost, aren’t you?"
You:Yeah, I’m trying to get back to the surface.
You:Wait... what are you?
Scary fish:"What am I? How rude!"
"I’m an Anglerfish, obviously."
*Anglerfish*:"Anyhow, you said you’re looking for a way back to the surface."
Anglerfish:"Well, I suppose I could help you, though you’ll need approval from our queen first."
You:"How do I get her approval?
Anglerfish:Well, through combat, of course!"
"Follow me, land dweller."
